   \boxed{P (\hat{i})} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}
   \boxed{P (\hat{j})} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}

2. Let's find the coefficients c, a and b such that:

